{"id": "DFmJqtgPYM7", "title": "Video by visionmachina", "description": "CyberCity Prologue: Betrayal\n\nThis is where it begins—the first glimpse into the world we’re building. A Chinatown-style back alley, midday. Two men face each other. They have history. Or at least, they did. There’s tension in the air, hesitation in their words. A betrayal, maybe? You can feel it in the way they talk. \n\nHow I Built This Scene with AI 🤖🎬 (Workflow)\n\n🖼️ Text-to-Image: Storyboarding started in @mid.journey, using generated images and my own character references to maintain consistency. I also built a dedicated CyberCity moodboard to keep the world’s aesthetic cohesive. (DM me if you want the moodboard profile code)\n\n🎥 Image-to-Video: With @klingai_official, I brought these images to life using camera angle prompts and character emotion prompts to add movement while keeping everything cinematic.\n\n🗣️ Text-to-Speech: The voices were created in @elevenlabsio , where I tweaked stability and variance settings to get the right tone. (Script was written entirely by me.)\n\n👄 Lip Sync: Back in Kling AI, I used their lip sync feature to get the characters speaking their lines.\n\n🎶 BGM / SFX: Audio was sourced directly from @capcutapp stock library, where I also did all the final editing.\n\nIf you’re into AI-driven storytelling or a brand looking to explore AI-generated content, let’s connect. Always open to exchanging ideas—or collaborating on something new. Drop me a DM.\n\nStay tuned for the next episode of Cybercity", "channel": "visionmachina", "uploader_id": "71483437226", "uploader": "VISION MACHINA", "timestamp": 1738556012, "like_count": 16, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.i